  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.850",
    "end": "00:03:36.680",
    "start_seconds": 214.85,
    "end_seconds": 216.68,
    "text": "Oh my God, I'm the only one who's"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.680",
    "end": "00:03:37.850",
    "start_seconds": 216.68,
    "end_seconds": 217.85,
    "text": "going to make fun of her for this."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.890",
    "end": "00:03:41.290",
    "start_seconds": 218.89,
    "end_seconds": 221.29,
    "text": "Like, this group of children"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.290",
    "end": "00:03:42.380",
    "start_seconds": 221.29,
    "end_seconds": 222.38,
    "text": "that I'm taking care of,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.380",
    "end": "00:03:44.049",
    "start_seconds": 222.38,
    "end_seconds": 224.049,
    "text": "they're so different than I was."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.049",
    "end": "00:03:44.990",
    "start_seconds": 224.049,
    "end_seconds": 224.99,
    "text": "Like, they've taken all their"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.990",
    "end": "00:03:46.299",
    "start_seconds": 224.99,
    "end_seconds": 226.299,
    "text": "daggers and put them away."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.299",
    "end": "00:03:48.129",
    "start_seconds": 226.299,
    "end_seconds": 228.129,
    "text": "They're sweet, they're accepting."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.129",
    "end": "00:03:48.899",
    "start_seconds": 228.129,
    "end_seconds": 228.899,
    "text": "It's not all good."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.899",
    "end": "00:03:50.219",
    "start_seconds": 228.899,
    "end_seconds": 230.219,
    "text": "No, no, it's not all good."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.629",
    "end": "00:03:52.429",
    "start_seconds": 230.629,
    "end_seconds": 232.429,
    "text": "Like, they, this generation of children"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.430",
    "end": "00:03:54.759",
    "start_seconds": 232.43,
    "end_seconds": 234.75900000000001,
    "text": "can't get ten feet from a water bottle"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.759",
    "end": "00:03:56.289",
    "start_seconds": 234.75900000000001,
    "end_seconds": 236.289,
    "text": "without being triggered in some way."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.349",
    "end": "00:03:58.160",
    "start_seconds": 236.349,
    "end_seconds": 238.16,
    "text": "They're the most hydrated group of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:58.160",
    "end": "00:04:00.399",
    "start_seconds": 238.16,
    "end_seconds": 240.399,
    "text": "kids I've ever met in my entire life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:01.579",
    "end": "00:04:02.719",
    "start_seconds": 241.579,
    "end_seconds": 242.719,
    "text": "It is a nightmare."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:03.235",
    "end": "00:04:04.745",
    "start_seconds": 243.235,
    "end_seconds": 244.745,
    "text": "They can't go through my math"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:04.745",
    "end": "00:04:06.015",
    "start_seconds": 244.745,
    "end_seconds": 246.015,
    "text": "lessons without a squishy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.015",
    "end": "00:04:07.535",
    "start_seconds": 246.015,
    "end_seconds": 247.535,
    "text": "thing or a stuffed animal."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:07.704",
    "end": "00:04:10.084",
    "start_seconds": 247.704,
    "end_seconds": 250.084,
    "text": "I had a girl last week in my math lesson"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.095",
    "end": "00:04:11.725",
    "start_seconds": 250.095,
    "end_seconds": 251.725,
    "text": "with a blanket wrapped around her."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:11.905",
    "end": "00:04:13.374",
    "start_seconds": 251.905,
    "end_seconds": 253.374,
    "text": "I said, what's up with the blanket?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:13.375",
    "end": "00:04:15.514",
    "start_seconds": 253.375,
    "end_seconds": 255.514,
    "text": "She said, it makes me happy during math."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.915",
    "end": "00:04:17.475",
    "start_seconds": 255.915,
    "end_seconds": 257.475,
    "text": "I said, math isn't happy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:17.625",
    "end": "00:04:18.474",
    "start_seconds": 257.625,
    "end_seconds": 258.474,
    "text": "It's awful."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.474",
    "end": "00:04:19.254",
    "start_seconds": 258.474,
    "end_seconds": 259.254,
    "text": "It's hard."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.254",
    "end": "00:04:20.225",
    "start_seconds": 259.254,
    "end_seconds": 260.225,
    "text": "It's onerous."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:20.545",
    "end": "00:04:21.704",
    "start_seconds": 260.545,
    "end_seconds": 261.704,
    "text": "I would have loved to have a water"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.704",
    "end": "00:04:24.275",
    "start_seconds": 261.704,
    "end_seconds": 264.275,
    "text": "bottle and a, and a blanket and a stuffed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.275",
    "end": "00:04:26.015",
    "start_seconds": 264.275,
    "end_seconds": 266.015,
    "text": "animal during math when I was a kid."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.330",
    "end": "00:04:28.470",
    "start_seconds": 266.33,
    "end_seconds": 268.47,
    "text": "All I had was angst and despair."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:28.470",
    "end": "00:04:29.840",
    "start_seconds": 268.47,
    "end_seconds": 269.84,
    "text": "It made me who I am."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:31.000",
    "end": "00:04:32.170",
    "start_seconds": 271.0,
    "end_seconds": 272.17,
    "text": "I can't stand these kids."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.410",
    "end": "00:04:35.499",
    "start_seconds": 272.40999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 275.499,
    "text": "And I'm losing the game because I have"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:35.499",
    "end": "00:04:37.459",
    "start_seconds": 275.499,
    "end_seconds": 277.459,
    "text": "done everything and they've done nothing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:37.459",
    "end": "00:04:39.360",
    "start_seconds": 277.459,
    "end_seconds": 279.36,
    "text": "so they're nine steps ahead of me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:40.749",
    "end": "00:04:43.730",
    "start_seconds": 280.749,
    "end_seconds": 283.73,
    "text": "And then the tallest girl says, Never"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.739",
    "end": "00:04:47.010",
    "start_seconds": 283.739,
    "end_seconds": 287.01,
    "text": "have I ever met my father's expectations."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:47.920",
    "end": "00:04:49.730",
    "start_seconds": 287.92,
    "end_seconds": 289.73,
    "text": "And I think, that is nonsense,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:49.750",
    "end": "00:04:50.860",
    "start_seconds": 289.75,
    "end_seconds": 290.86,
    "text": "because I know your fathers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.860",
    "end": "00:04:52.010",
    "start_seconds": 290.86,
    "end_seconds": 292.01,
    "text": "They're all fine men."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:52.010",
    "end": "00:04:53.270",
    "start_seconds": 292.01,
    "end_seconds": 293.27,
    "text": "What are you talking about?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:53.665",
    "end": "00:04:55.205",
    "start_seconds": 293.665,
    "end_seconds": 295.205,
    "text": "And one of the girls says, Well, I'm a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:55.205",
    "end": "00:04:57.415",
    "start_seconds": 295.205,
    "end_seconds": 297.415,
    "text": "swimmer, and when I get a PR in the pool"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.415",
    "end": "00:04:59.235",
    "start_seconds": 297.415,
    "end_seconds": 299.235,
    "text": "and I come out, my dad's happy for me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.505",
    "end": "00:05:01.784",
    "start_seconds": 299.505,
    "end_seconds": 301.784,
    "text": "But then he says, But just imagine how"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:01.785",
    "end": "00:05:03.025",
    "start_seconds": 301.785,
    "end_seconds": 303.025,
    "text": "much better you could have been if you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:03.025",
    "end": "00:05:05.274",
    "start_seconds": 303.025,
    "end_seconds": 305.274,
    "text": "had nailed the kick turn on the third lap."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:05.885",
    "end": "00:05:07.594",
    "start_seconds": 305.885,
    "end_seconds": 307.594,
    "text": "And the next girl says, Well, I mastered"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:07.594",
    "end": "00:05:09.255",
    "start_seconds": 307.594,
    "end_seconds": 309.255,
    "text": "my multiplication facts last month, and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:09.255",
    "end": "00:05:10.735",
    "start_seconds": 309.255,
    "end_seconds": 310.735,
    "text": "when I came home to my dad, he said,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:10.735",
    "end": "00:05:12.325",
    "start_seconds": 310.735,
    "end_seconds": 312.325,
    "text": "That's great, but why didn't you do it"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:12.325",
    "end": "00:05:14.145",
    "start_seconds": 312.325,
    "end_seconds": 314.145,
    "text": "in October when you were supposed to?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:14.735",
    "end": "00:05:16.745",
    "start_seconds": 314.735,
    "end_seconds": 316.745,
    "text": "And the third one says, My dad always"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:16.765",
    "end": "00:05:18.635",
    "start_seconds": 316.765,
    "end_seconds": 318.635,
    "text": "tells me how I can be better, and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:18.635",
    "end": "00:05:20.335",
    "start_seconds": 318.635,
    "end_seconds": 320.335,
    "text": "I know he does it because he loves"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:20.335",
    "end": "00:05:23.105",
    "start_seconds": 320.335,
    "end_seconds": 323.105,
    "text": "me, but it never feels like love."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:23.920",
    "end": "00:05:25.130",
    "start_seconds": 323.92,
    "end_seconds": 325.13,
    "text": "And now I'm panicking."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:25.130",
    "end": "00:05:26.190",
    "start_seconds": 325.13,
    "end_seconds": 326.19,
    "text": "I'm thinking what about my"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:26.190",
    "end": "00:05:27.460",
    "start_seconds": 326.19,
    "end_seconds": 327.46,
    "text": "children, Charlie and Clara?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:27.470",
    "end": "00:05:28.770",
    "start_seconds": 327.47,
    "end_seconds": 328.77,
    "text": "Have I ever told them that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:28.770",
    "end": "00:05:30.430",
    "start_seconds": 328.77,
    "end_seconds": 330.43,
    "text": "they've met my expectations?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:30.530",
    "end": "00:05:31.350",
    "start_seconds": 330.53,
    "end_seconds": 331.35,
    "text": "They never have."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:31.350",
    "end": "00:05:32.589",
    "start_seconds": 331.35,
    "end_seconds": 332.589,
    "text": "I mean, they don't even come close."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:33.190",
    "end": "00:05:35.659",
    "start_seconds": 333.19,
    "end_seconds": 335.659,
    "text": "Like, but how have I at least"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:35.660",
    "end": "00:05:37.640",
    "start_seconds": 335.65999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 337.64,
    "text": "fooled them into believing that they"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:37.640",
    "end": "00:05:39.880",
    "start_seconds": 337.64,
    "end_seconds": 339.88,
    "text": "occasionally meet my expectations?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:40.819",
    "end": "00:05:42.470",
    "start_seconds": 340.819,
    "end_seconds": 342.47,
    "text": "And so as I'm panicking about"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:42.470",
    "end": "00:05:44.100",
    "start_seconds": 342.47,
    "end_seconds": 344.1,
    "text": "this situation, the tall girl"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:44.100",
    "end": "00:05:46.310",
    "start_seconds": 344.1,
    "end_seconds": 346.31,
    "text": "says, Mr. Dicks, have you ever"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:46.310",
    "end": "00:05:48.090",
    "start_seconds": 346.31,
    "end_seconds": 348.09000000000003,
    "text": "met your father's expectations?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:49.140",
    "end": "00:05:50.440",
    "start_seconds": 349.14,
    "end_seconds": 350.44,
    "text": "And I catch for a minute."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:50.460",
    "end": "00:05:51.570",
    "start_seconds": 350.46,
    "end_seconds": 351.57,
    "text": "I don't know what to say."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:52.375",
    "end": "00:05:53.935",
    "start_seconds": 352.375,
    "end_seconds": 353.935,
    "text": "But then I know exactly what to say"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:53.995",
    "end": "00:05:55.295",
    "start_seconds": 353.995,
    "end_seconds": 355.295,
    "text": "because I've been working with kids for"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:55.295",
    "end": "00:05:57.664",
    "start_seconds": 355.295,
    "end_seconds": 357.664,
    "text": "25 years as a teacher and I know they're,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:58.425",
    "end": "00:06:00.565",
    "start_seconds": 358.425,
    "end_seconds": 360.565,
    "text": "they're more capable than we all know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:01.094",
    "end": "00:06:04.585",
    "start_seconds": 361.094,
    "end_seconds": 364.585,
    "text": "And so I tell her, I say, my father left"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:04.585",
    "end": "00:06:07.094",
    "start_seconds": 364.585,
    "end_seconds": 367.094,
    "text": "when I was seven and he never came back."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:07.474",
    "end": "00:06:09.174",
    "start_seconds": 367.474,
    "end_seconds": 369.174,
    "text": "And so I don't think he ever"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:09.174",
    "end": "00:06:10.914",
    "start_seconds": 369.174,
    "end_seconds": 370.914,
    "text": "had expectations for me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:11.735",
    "end": "00:06:14.155",
    "start_seconds": 371.735,
    "end_seconds": 374.155,
    "text": "And three hands reach out and they"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:14.164",
    "end": "00:06:16.765",
    "start_seconds": 374.164,
    "end_seconds": 376.765,
    "text": "grab my wrist and they pull me forward."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:17.565",
    "end": "00:06:18.865",
    "start_seconds": 377.565,
    "end_seconds": 378.865,
    "text": "And that girl says,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:19.065",
    "end": "00:06:20.715",
    "start_seconds": 379.065,
    "end_seconds": 380.715,
    "text": "That counts, Mr. Dicks."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:22.415",
    "end": "00:06:25.925",
    "start_seconds": 382.415,
    "end_seconds": 385.925,
    "text": "And then she tells me, I'm sorry your"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:25.925",
    "end": "00:06:28.275",
    "start_seconds": 385.925,
    "end_seconds": 388.275,
    "text": "father abandoned you when you were a kid."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:29.515",
    "end": "00:06:34.094",
    "start_seconds": 389.515,
    "end_seconds": 394.094,
    "text": "And it is crazy, but from the age"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:34.094",
    "end": "00:06:39.535",
    "start_seconds": 394.094,
    "end_seconds": 399.53499999999997,
    "text": "of 7 to 52, I have basically been"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:39.535",
    "end": "00:06:41.875",
    "start_seconds": 399.53499999999997,
    "end_seconds": 401.875,
    "text": "waiting for my father to come back."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:42.675",
    "end": "00:06:44.064",
    "start_seconds": 402.675,
    "end_seconds": 404.064,
    "text": "And it is not until I'm on a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:44.065",
    "end": "00:06:46.825",
    "start_seconds": 404.065,
    "end_seconds": 406.825,
    "text": "sidewalk with a 10 year old girl."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:47.605",
    "end": "00:06:49.145",
    "start_seconds": 407.605,
    "end_seconds": 409.145,
    "text": "That I understand for the first"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:49.155",
    "end": "00:06:52.395",
    "start_seconds": 409.155,
    "end_seconds": 412.395,
    "text": "time that he is not coming back."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:52.855",
    "end": "00:06:55.115",
    "start_seconds": 412.855,
    "end_seconds": 415.115,
    "text": "It is the first time I have ever"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:55.165",
    "end": "00:06:58.384",
    "start_seconds": 415.165,
    "end_seconds": 418.384,
    "text": "in my life heard the word abandoned"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:58.415",
    "end": "00:07:01.115",
    "start_seconds": 418.415,
    "end_seconds": 421.115,
    "text": "used to describe what happened to me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:02.105",
    "end": "00:07:04.504",
    "start_seconds": 422.105,
    "end_seconds": 424.504,
    "text": "And it is the first time ever that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:04.504",
    "end": "00:07:06.925",
    "start_seconds": 424.504,
    "end_seconds": 426.925,
    "text": "a human being has ever said to me,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:08.055",
    "end": "00:07:10.045",
    "start_seconds": 428.055,
    "end_seconds": 430.045,
    "text": "I'm sorry that happened to you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:10.565",
    "end": "00:07:13.335",
    "start_seconds": 430.565,
    "end_seconds": 433.335,
    "text": "My friends have said, that sucked."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:13.725",
    "end": "00:07:14.645",
    "start_seconds": 433.725,
    "end_seconds": 434.645,
    "text": "It was terrible."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:14.655",
    "end": "00:07:16.054",
    "start_seconds": 434.655,
    "end_seconds": 436.054,
    "text": "Well, I know that my wife."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:16.815",
    "end": "00:07:19.725",
    "start_seconds": 436.815,
    "end_seconds": 439.725,
    "text": "hates what happened to me as a boy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:21.205",
    "end": "00:07:23.615",
    "start_seconds": 441.205,
    "end_seconds": 443.615,
    "text": "But that ten year old girl, she was the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:23.615",
    "end": "00:07:28.044",
    "start_seconds": 443.615,
    "end_seconds": 448.044,
    "text": "first person to tell me, I am sorry for"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:28.044",
    "end": "00:07:29.955",
    "start_seconds": 448.044,
    "end_seconds": 449.955,
    "text": "what happened to you when you were seven."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:32.945",
    "end": "00:07:36.034",
    "start_seconds": 452.945,
    "end_seconds": 456.034,
    "text": "When people ask me today why I am still"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:36.444",
    "end": "00:07:39.375",
    "start_seconds": 456.444,
    "end_seconds": 459.375,
    "text": "a public school teacher after 25 years,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:39.775",
    "end": "00:07:43.135",
    "start_seconds": 459.775,
    "end_seconds": 463.135,
    "text": "with all of the unspeakable, ridiculous,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:43.554",
    "end": "00:07:47.015",
    "start_seconds": 463.554,
    "end_seconds": 467.015,
    "text": "nonsensical, impossible things."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:47.720",
    "end": "00:07:49.870",
    "start_seconds": 467.72,
    "end_seconds": 469.87,
    "text": "that schoolteachers go through today,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:50.520",
    "end": "00:07:52.500",
    "start_seconds": 470.52,
    "end_seconds": 472.5,
    "text": "and with, quite honestly, all the other"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:52.510",
    "end": "00:07:55.030",
    "start_seconds": 472.51,
    "end_seconds": 475.03,
    "text": "opportunities I have to leave a classroom"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:55.070",
    "end": "00:07:57.929",
    "start_seconds": 475.07,
    "end_seconds": 477.929,
    "text": "and go do other things with my life, my"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:57.929",
    "end": "00:08:01.150",
    "start_seconds": 477.929,
    "end_seconds": 481.15,
    "text": "answer is always immediate and simple."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:02.759",
    "end": "00:08:06.250",
    "start_seconds": 482.759,
    "end_seconds": 486.25,
    "text": "I love kids, but far more important"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:06.250",
    "end": "00:08:12.540",
    "start_seconds": 486.25,
    "end_seconds": 492.54,
    "text": "than that, kids understand me, and they"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:12.550",
    "end": "00:08:16.409",
    "start_seconds": 492.55,
    "end_seconds": 496.409,
    "text": "speak truth to me, and they love me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:17.610",
    "end": "00:08:17.840",
    "start_seconds": 497.61,
    "end_seconds": 497.84,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:26.719",
    "end": "00:08:27.900",
    "start_seconds": 506.719,
    "end_seconds": 507.9,
    "text": "Matthew Dicks!"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:34.580",
    "end": "00:08:35.179",
    "start_seconds": 514.58,
    "end_seconds": 515.179,
    "text": "Matthew Dicks!"
  }
]
